  "isLiveDataset": false,
  "rai:dataCollection": "Queries and evidence chains were extracted from public NRC RAI documents (NuScale and Levy County dockets) using a four-phase GPT-4.1 pipeline: extraction, validation, chain construction, and judge filtering. Two stratified samples were independently annotated by two domain experts (Cohen's kappa = 0.88 for evidence chains, 0.94 for reference-type taxonomy).",
  "rai:dataPreprocessingProtocol": "Source PDFs were parsed to text with section-anchor preservation (the section field of each chain element). RAI questions and evidence chains were extracted by GPT-4.1, validated against source passages, and filtered by an LLM-as-judge for faithfulness (judge_score >= 4 of 5).",
  "rai:dataReleaseMaintenancePlan": "Versioned releases on Zenodo. Bug fixes and metadata updates issued as new minor versions sharing a concept DOI.",
  "rai:personalSensitiveInformation": "None. The dataset is derived from public regulatory documents and contains no personal data.",
